WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.410
You send a screenshot. They send back questions.

00:00:04.067 --> 00:00:05.687
Time to get to the point.

00:00:08.733 --> 00:00:09.933
Meet Snapper.

00:00:10.467 --> 00:00:13.497
It lives in your menu bar. Pointing is its thing.

00:00:13.733 --> 00:00:15.023
One shortcut.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:16.490
Snap.

00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:18.573
Box the number.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:20.180
Point at the proof.

00:00:21.067 --> 00:00:25.090
Hide what's nobody's business. Zoom in, so nobody squints.

00:00:25.433 --> 00:00:26.833
Dress it up a little.

00:00:27.933 --> 00:00:29.233
Copy. Done.

00:00:31.467 --> 00:00:32.737
Paste it anywhere.

00:00:33.067 --> 00:00:36.247
No follow-up questions. Imagine that. Need it moving?

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:38.370
Record. Trim. Send.

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:42.637
Snapper.

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.730
Screenshots that make the point.
